# Faces fade in and out at the heads' own speeds (S_* about a second, T_HURT 0.1 s), and a new face takes
# over from the last one gradually. Xardas, the camera at his face. The report flags face_jump: a face that
# came or went at once. Columns face_* of metrics.csv: how much of each face shows.
cheat god
view clean 30
watch nearest
freeze nearest
wait 500
place 150 0
cam face 45 15 1
wait 800
rec fade
wait 300
faceanim nearest S_FRIENDLY 1500   # in, held, out
wait 3800
faceanim nearest S_ANGRY 4000
wait 1500
faceanim nearest S_FRIENDLY 2000   # angry gives way to friendly
wait 500
faceanim nearest S_ANGRY 2000      # and back before friendly is fully in: no jump
wait 3500
faceanim nearest S_FRIENDLY 2000   # three faces a moment apart: the slots run short
wait 300
faceanim nearest S_HOSTILE 2000
wait 300
faceanim nearest S_FRIGHTENED 2000
wait 4000
faceanim nearest T_HURT 800        # pain comes fast
wait 1500
stop
wait 500
faceanim nearest S_ANGRY 4000
speak nearest DIA_Addon_Xardas_Hello_14_00
rec talk                           # the lips over a face that fades out
wait 9000
stop
